      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْهُمٌ صُنْعَةٌ</span></b> , with damm, <i>Arrows that are equal,
equable, uniform,</i> or <i>even, the work of one man.</i>
(TA.) [Perhaps <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُنْعَةٌ</span> is a quasi-pl. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَنِيعٌ</span>
applied to an arrow.]

